---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About" 
  description="The Center for Sentience Research (CSR) is an independent non-profit based in Zurich, Switzerland, dedicated to modeling the physical foundations of awareness."
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="py-20 border-b border-csr-gray-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-csr-primary font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">About CSR</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">
        A new science for <span class="text-gradient">the map of experience</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-csr-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        The Center for Sentience Research (CSR) is an independent non-profit research institute headquartered in Zurich, Switzerland. We exist to build the first rigorous, substrate-neutral science of consciousness.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission -->
  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="text-csr-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          We bridge physics, neuroscience, and philosophy to understand how sentience arises across all substrates — biological, digital, and physical. Our work is grounded in the conviction that consciousness is not a philosophical mystery but a physical phenomenon subject to mathematical modeling.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Why It Matters</h2>
        <p class="text-csr-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          As we move toward an era of increasingly complex autonomous and artificial systems, understanding the physical foundations of sentience is a requirement for survival. We must learn to recognize — and measure — awareness wherever it could arise, not just where it looks like us. The moral and governance implications of getting this wrong are profound.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Our Approach</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-6">
          <div class="p-6 border border-csr-gray-100 rounded-2xl">
            <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Substrate Neutrality</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-csr-gray-600">We investigate sentience as a fundamental physical property that can emerge in biological cells, neural networks, or exotic physical states.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 border border-csr-gray-100 rounded-2xl">
            <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Quantitative Modeling</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-csr-gray-600">Our work goes beyond metaphor, using high-dimensional data analysis and computational physics to build predictive maps of consciousness.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 border border-csr-gray-100 rounded-2xl">
            <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Ethical Expansion</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-csr-gray-600">Understanding sentience is a prerequisite for expanding our moral circle. We study the ethical implications of future minds and non-human awareness.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Advisory Board</h2>
        <p class="text-csr-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Our work is guided by an advisory board of independent thinkers across philosophy, neuroscience, and philanthropy:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="p-6 border border-csr-gray-100 rounded-2xl">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-1">David Pearce</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-csr-primary font-mono uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Advisor</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-csr-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Philosopher and transhumanist. Co-founder of Humanity+ and author of <i>The Hedonistic Imperative</i>, foundational text on the abolition of suffering through technology.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 border border-csr-gray-100 rounded-2xl">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-1">Alexander Björkman</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-csr-primary font-mono uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Advisor</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-csr-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              Ekskäret Foundation. Focuses on facilitating conscious societal development, lifelong learning, and creating spaces for deep reflection and systemic change.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Founding & Structure</h2>
        <p class="text-csr-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          CSR was founded in 2026 by Jhonatan Serna. We operate as an independent non-profit with a "Transparency-First" model — annual research outputs and financial summaries are made public to the global research community. We are headquartered in Zurich, Switzerland.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact CTA -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-csr-gray-50 border-t border-csr-gray-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Get Involved</h2>
      <p class="text-csr-gray-600 mb-8">We welcome collaborators, researchers, and philanthropic partners who share our commitment to understanding the nature of mind.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary px-8 py-4 bg-csr-primary text-white rounded-full font-semibold hover:bg-csr-primary-dark transition-all">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
